      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Urea-formaldehyde is a non-transparent thermosetting resin or plastic, made from urea and formaldehyde. It is used in adhesives, finishes, Medium-density fiberboard (MDF), and electrical components. Any urea-formaldehyde product that does not claim water-insoluble nitrogen as a percentage of the total nitrogen, will probably release nitrogen quickly.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "脲醛是一种不透明的热固性树脂或塑料，由尿素和甲醛制成。它用于粘合剂、饰面、中密度纤维板（MDF）和电气元件。任何不声称水不溶性氮占总氮百分比的脲醛产品都可能快速释放氮。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
